    "后台自动补全依赖 iOS 系统调度，不保证实时；如果长时间没有自动生效，可以手动使用「扫描历史」，或者重新打开一次本 App。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Background auto-backfill relies on iOS system scheduling and isn't guaranteed to run immediately. If it hasn't kicked in after a while, use “Scan History” manually, or reopen this app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台自动补全依赖 iOS 系统调度，不保证实时；如果长时间没有自动生效，可以手动使用「扫描历史」，或者重新打开一次本 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
